|Category|Sensing / Wearable
|Capabilities|Position anywhere; faces and distress; heart rate.
|Limitations|Continuous monitoring.
|Maturity and feasibility|High.
|Failure and fallback behaviour|Not applicable - rejected.
|Benefits|Finds a resident beyond the garden; sees distress the guide cannot.
|Drawbacks|Felt as surveillance; violates HV-03. Distress is left to people.
|Selected or rejected|Rejected.

